Sources & Notes: This concept draws on Norse myth and JJK canon. The runes and Yggdrasil are based on Odin’s lore[12][8] (runes “carry intentions” through the world-tree), as are binds/banishing chants[8]. Valkyries guide fallen warriors[2] and berserkers fight in an unstoppable fury[3], reflected in our spirit summons. Domain rules follow JJK: Domain attacks auto-hit inside[4], open area domains match Sukuna’s shrine[5], etc. We intentionally balanced this domain to 50/50 with Lunar Dirge by giving each countermeasures (for example, rune-wards vs sonic attacks[8]) and assuming similar ranges (Tier 3 ~200m[6]). All high-power effects are inspired by mythology but tweaked for game balance. Assumptions: Tier radii as above, domain open-air, and each rune’s effect scaled by tier.
